  "implemented_behavior": "Exact table arithmetic and structured cell-to-chart fidelity with explicit missing data and axes.",
  "bounded_contract": "`summary`: unique row IDs, rational values or null, missing_policy reject/exclude_explicit; sum, mean, odd/even median, observed/missing counts and excluded IDs; all missing rejected.\n`percent_change`: positive baseline, nonnegative final value; 100(after-before)/before.\n`weighted_mean`: unique rows with nonnegative weight and signed rational values; total weight strictly positive.\n`chart_fidelity`: source_rows vs chart_points joined by ID; explicit source/chart units, bar/line/scatter type and bounded linear/log y_axis. Mismatched unit labels are not implicitly converted. Missing/extra/wrong/out-of-axis values are defects. Zero-excluding bar axes and log scales generate separate presentation warnings.",
  "bounds_and_open_scope": "No PDF table extraction, raster chart interpretation, render verification or holistic visual-quality judgment. Data fidelity can pass while presentation warnings remain; neither proves good pedagogy.",
